from build_magazine import page,write,image
body='<section class="library-heading wrap"><p class="eyebrow">From the family camera roll</p><h1>The good bits.</h1><p class="article-dek">A few ordinary New England moments.</p><p class="quiet-copy">Original family photographs already shared on An AUsome Life. The people in these images have not been generated or altered for this design.</p></section><section class="wrap camera-roll"><figure>'+image('/assets/orchard-afternoon-clean.jpg','A child sitting beneath an apple tree during an orchard afternoon.')+'<figcaption><h2>An orchard afternoon.</h2><p>The simple outings are often the keepers.</p><a href="/shorter-visit-plan.html">Plan a shorter visit →</a></figcaption></figure><figure>'+image('/assets/book-barn-ct-clean.jpg','A child browsing an outdoor bookshelf at the Book Barn in Connecticut.')+'<figcaption><h2>A Book Barn detour.</h2><p>Books, gardens and room to wander.</p><a href="/favorite-places-book-barn-niantic.html">The practical Book Barn guide →</a></figcaption></figure><figure>'+image('/assets/york-maine-clean.jpg','A family photograph from York, Maine.')+'<figcaption><h2>A little time in York.</h2><p>Water, a view and the option to keep the day simple.</p><a href="/favorite-places-york-nubble.html">The York + Nubble guide →</a></figcaption></figure><figure>'+image('/assets/aquarium-visit.webp','Watching a diver through an aquarium viewing window.')+'<figcaption><h2>A moment by the water.</h2><p>The practical details make room for the good part.</p><a href="/favorite-places/new-england-aquarium.html">The aquarium field notes →</a></figcaption></figure></section>'
